Portions of this library — specifically the concept-document parser/
serializer, the concept-id/path conventions, and the index-generation logic —
are ports of the OKF reference implementation (the Python
`enrichment_agent.bundle` package: `document.py`, `paths.py`, `index.py`). The
OKF v0.1 specification (SPEC.md) authored by that project is implemented
here.

The attribution chain for these ports is:

    OKF reference implementation (Python, Google LLC)
      -> this repository's former Rust implementation, `okf`
         (removed at commit d20343c; Apache-2.0)
      -> OKF4net, this C# port (Apache-2.0)

OKF4net is a from-scratch C# port of the Rust `okf` crate that previously
lived in this repository (proven byte-exact against it before the Rust
sources were removed, see `tests/fixtures/`); it carries forward the same
derivative-work relationship to the original OKF reference implementation.
These files have been rewritten in C# and modified from their original form
at each step of that chain.

